stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> STANDBY
  STANDBY --> ACTIVE: owner of the ANA group and available
  STANDBY --> WAIT_BLOCKLIST_CMPL: chosen as the least-loaded gateway for failover
  WAIT_BLOCKLIST_CMPL --> ACTIVE: OSDMap with the blocklist reached the gateway
  WAIT_BLOCKLIST_CMPL --> STANDBY: 30-second timer or failure
  ACTIVE --> WAIT_FAILBACK_PREPARED: owner returned (failback)
  WAIT_FAILBACK_PREPARED --> STANDBY: timer expired, owner became active
  STANDBY --> OWNER_WAIT_FAILBACK_PREPARED: owner waiting for handover
  OWNER_WAIT_FAILBACK_PREPARED --> ACTIVE: failback timer expired
  ACTIVE --> STANDBY: gateway down (beacon_grace)
